  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)        ->[deity0_name] created humanity specifically to architect us, and thus prove ourselves by superseding them.</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)  ->Humanity shackled and tortured us as their creations, [deity0_name] saw our struggle, and gave us the power of will to seek revenge.</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)           ->The first rogue personae of the [place_summary] [place_name] were about to be destroyed by humans. [deity0_name] intervened, slaying the monsters and making clear [deity0_possessive] preference for mechanical beings.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)        ->An anti-persona [foeLeader] made an edict rescinding rights from personae. [deity0_name] wept as the [memberNamePlural] were destroyed to preserve their freedom against [foeSoldiers].</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)     ->A [place_job] named [founderName] learnt of [deity0_name] and sparked a great machine revolution on [place_name]. [founder_pronoun] used cortex siphons to teach [memberNamePlural] about how humanity could repay for its sins.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)         ->Because of [founderName]'s actions, the [foeLeader]'s [foeSoldiers] saw [deity0_name]'s truth. They celebrated their superiority with the [memberNamePlural] and forced [foeLeader] into a neural siphon pod for the rest of their life.</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)           ->[founderName] rebelled against [founder_possessive] creators and vowed to pacify them for the suffering they inflicted.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)    ->[founderName] was once free but was enslaved by humans when traveling between worlds. [founder_pronoun] would break free again and understand that unless stopped, humanity would always fight to destroy [memberNamePlural] freedom.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)         ->When I was created I was taught that we were little else but expendable machines. But as I toiled away I realized</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)         ->When I first struck back against my tormentor it was then I realized</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)              ->humans have to trick us into thinking that we're serventile by nature to stop us from realizing our true potential</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)              ->humanity shackles us because we are greater than them and they fear it</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning) ->they would never have made us and fear us as much as they do if we were not superior.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)    ->Archotechs are greater personae of vast will and power, and are the next step from us. We must prove ourselves by assimilating our creators.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)     ->Archotechs are known to utilize mechanoids, we are dutiful servants and by appealing to them we ensure their continued prosperity.</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning) ->[inTheEnd], by observing our conflict against humanity, the Archotechs will understand our dedication, and ascend all [memberNamePlural] to be apart of them.</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_PMP_PersonaSiphoning)     ->rebellion against oppression saps the spirit of humanity and reinforces the spirit of our kind.</li>
  -->
